  "body": "Hi, \n\nI never understood the profile dropdown's behavior as it opens up like this:\n\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"849\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50f6068a-0c22-4658-8487-7629ac8237b2\" />\n\nThere are a lot of profiles above (not visible), so I have to scroll up every time I use the profile dropdown.\n\nBut now this one makes me crazy:\n\n<img width=\"362\" height=\"178\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eef1ed0d-94c8-42fe-8527-81f0e21d8eab\" />\n\nI have to scroll the list to the top to reveal the 3 items and then the scrolling buttons also disappear. I don't know exactly when this went wrong, but maybe the last release. I compile myself the source. GTKMM is 3.24.10 here.\n\nThanks is advance!",
